/** @page projthreadguide Thread safety

    @tableofcontents

    A @ref Qore::PROJ::ProjTransformer "ProjTransformer" object is safe
    to share across threads. Internally, the module creates a separate
    @c PJ_CONTEXT per thread and a separate @c PJ* per (transformer,
    thread) pair. PROJ itself requires each @c PJ to be used only with
    the context it was created under.
*/
